      "message": "This is an alternative approach wher the preferred device logic is ingored in the engine when calling from getInputForAttr.\n\nIt probably miss another fix where only inputs shareing the same profile are considered in findPreferredDevice() but this might be tricky to implement because of the missing context at the call site.",
